Subject: [PATCH] feat(browser): QR generation, gallery scan and sharing

- BrowserQr: zxing encode (navy/ivory brand colors) and decode with a
  strict http(s)-only whitelist; javascript:/data:/intent: payloads are
  rejected before they can ever reach the browser
- BrowserQrActivity: generate current page QR, share via app file
  provider, decode from scaled gallery image and hand the sanitized URL
  back to the browser
- Browser menu gains QR entries; zxing core reused from the app
